title: "find-those-polyps"
abstract: >-
  A benchmark of unsupervised and self-supervised representation learning
  methods for colonoscopy and gastrointestinal endoscopy imaging, which
  evaluates frozen encoders on 35 tasks drawn from 14 open, labelled datasets
  streamed from their official hosts.
